    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know those hotlines exist but they just give you scripts. it doesn't change the fact that i'm just a void. like, if a person is already gone in every way that counts, why does it even matter if they're physically here? it feels like i'm just prolonging something that already ended.",
